OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a
OL,6,Fdry evening and mostly cloudy with
OL,7,Fsome clear intervals. Staying dry
OL,8,Fovernight with perhaps some longer
OL,9,Fclear spells developing. Strong winds
OL,10,Fin the west.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FThe day will continue dry with
OL,13,Fbright or sunny spells increasing into
OL,14,Fthe afternoon. Cloud will spread east
OL,15,Fin the evening. Strong winds in the
OL,16,Fwest easing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
