OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fwith outbreaks of rain spreading east
OL,7,FSaturday. Sunday and Monday will
OL,8,Fcontinue mostly dry with bright or
OL,9,Fsunny spells. Increasing fog risk
OL,10,FMonday.
